WEBVTT

00:04:58.753 --> 00:05:00.880
or confront an uncertain future.

00:05:01.797 --> 00:05:03.341
It is extremely difficult,

00:05:03.382 --> 00:05:07.386
and it requires a strong support system,

00:05:07.428 --> 00:05:11.307
something that you and I
can build together.

00:05:13.851 --> 00:05:15.019
So that ...

00:05:15.853 --> 00:05:20.900
hopefully, less and less people
will ... suffer in silence.

00:05:23.361 --> 00:05:26.822
We need to effectively heal

00:05:26.864 --> 00:05:28.866
to fight inequality.

00:05:29.992 --> 00:05:32.203
The only way for us to build,